                <div class="faq-item">
                  <a href="#" class="faq-trigger w-inline-block" data-ix="faq-item">
                    <h4 class="faq-heading">How can I get the best use out of my IceBeanie?</h4>
                    <div class="icon accordion-icon">+</div>
                    <div class="icon-minus accordion-icon">–</div>
                  </a>
                  <div class="faq-item-content">
                    <p class="faq-paragraph">Upon receiving your IceBeanie first place on your head and flatten the gel inserts to mold to your shaped head. Then, carefully place in freezer for 45-1hr. Feel free to increase the freeze time to your desired temp. If gel inserts become too hard or cold allow the IceBeanie to sit and warm to your desired temp and feel before use. If you’d like softer gel inserts—just reach out and we will ship to you!</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                  <a href="#" class="faq-trigger w-inline-block" data-ix="faq-item">
                    <h4 class="faq-heading">What currency are the prices I see in the site?</h4>
                    <div class="icon accordion-icon">+</div>
                    <div class="icon-minus accordion-icon">–</div>
