                <div class="faq-item">
                  <a href="#" class="faq-trigger w-inline-block" data-ix="faq-item">
                    <h4 class="faq-heading">Does it cover the base of the skull to the neck with an ice pack?</h4>
                    <div class="icon accordion-icon">+</div>
                    <div class="icon-minus accordion-icon">–</div>
                  </a>
                  <div class="faq-item-content">
                    <p class="faq-paragraph">IceBeanie covers the head, not the neck. However, some of our customers have found wearing the IceBeanie backwards can cover those additional areas!</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                  <a href="#" class="faq-trigger w-inline-block" data-ix="faq-item">
                    <h4 class="faq-heading">Are the ice packs flexible?</h4>
                    <div class="icon accordion-icon">+</div>
                    <div class="icon-minus accordion-icon">–</div>
                  </a>
                  <div class="faq-item-content">
                    <p class="faq-paragraph">Yes! Depending on how long you freeze we recommend you allow the product to sit briefly after removing from freezer. This will allow the IceBeanie to soften to your desired feel, and temperature.</p>
