                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                  <a href="#" class="faq-trigger w-inline-block" data-ix="faq-item">
                    <h4 class="faq-heading">How many ice packs does the IceBeanie contain? Do they wrap all around the head and forehead?</h4>
