                    <p class="faq-paragraph">We offer a 100 % money back guarantee, if the product is defective or damaged. We give you 30 days to send it back to us for a full refund. You must ship it back at your own expense, once we have received the product we will refund the full amount of your original purchase. Please Include a name and order number on the returned parcels.<br><br><em>Please note:</em> If you your package is on the way, you must wait for it to arrive and return it before receiving a refund.</p>
